Subject: Vendor risk update: {{ vendor_id }} is now {{ risk_band }}{% if risk_score is not none %} ({{ risk_score }}){% endif %}
---
Hello,

A vendor's risk score has been recomputed.

  Vendor ID:            {{ vendor_id }}
  Risk band:            {{ risk_band }}
  Risk score:           {{ risk_score if risk_score is not none else 'Unrated' }}
  Rating status:        {{ rating_status if rating_status is defined else 'assessed' }}
  Model version:        {{ model_version }}
  Scored at:            {{ scored_at }}

Top contributing factors:
{% for factor in top_factors %}
  - {{ factor.feature }}: {{ factor.contribution }}
{% endfor %}
{% if risk_band == "High" %}

This vendor is now HIGH RISK — please review before any new spend.
{% endif %}

— IT Procurement Platform
